twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	method `S.peek` is not declared `unsafe`, but its body names a value of unsafe type (`UnsafePointer<Int>`)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: method `S.peek` is not declared `unsafe`, but its body names a value of unsafe type (`UnsafePointer<Int>`)"
