log	" 12 |     func peek(&self) -> Int { self.p[0] }"
log	"     |                                   ^"
log	"   hint: write `func peek(...) unsafe` — the unsafety belongs in the signature where every caller can see it; if the operation is sound for every input, keep the wrapper unsafe and expose a safe one that checks its arguments"
